{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:5YEOFR19VerificationOutcomeO","title":"VerificationOutcome","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerificationOutcome","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VerificationOutcome","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The answer to one verification transaction — the certified decision."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/accept(similarity:)","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/noFace","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/reject(_:similarity:)"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/similarity"]},{"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/window"]},{"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/decide(faceSeen:padVerdict:denial:matched:similarity:)"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRecord","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationDepth","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRejection","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/SpoofVerdict","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/SpoofReason","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRDepthVerdict","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRDepthVerdictDetail","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InconclusiveReason","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InvalidFrameReason","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/TrustDecisionPath","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFusionTrace","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/RecognitionLatchSnapshot"],"anchor":"Trust--liveness-verdicts","generated":true,"title":"Trust & liveness verdicts"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/verificationoutcome"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"VerificationOutcome","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A transaction (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession\/verify(window:faceWidthEnvelope:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") observes the live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/window","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ends in exactly one of these. The rule is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed: no face acquired is a failure to acquire; a presentation attack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"denial wins over a match; a check that ran but never graded a held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"genuine second produces no decision (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationRejection\/notGradable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":");","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and only a held-genuine presentation with a match anywhere in the window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepts. A face out of frame for the transaction’s face-width envelope","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(too far, too close, cut by an edge) and a liveness CNN with no decided","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verdict yet grade nothing: such a sample breaks a genuine run, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"denial read on an out-of-frame face does not count. With the liveness CNN on, the genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second starts only once a CNN run has completed after the transaction","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opened, and a frame the CNN was offered and did not score (refused by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"frame-quality gate, no crop) breaks it, the next one again starting on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run completed after that frame: the verdict standing at the press, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through frames the CNN refused, cannot hold it on its own. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"match is earned after the press too: the press takes the recognition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"latch cold, so only a match the latch reaches inside the window counts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is bound to the window, not to the held second or to a face.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Hosts take the decision from here, never from per-frame scores. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"laboratory measures this rule; an integration that rebuilds its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(accepts on one trusted frame, shortens the window, drops a signal)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not inherit the measured FAR, FRR and IAPAR.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/LivenessFusionTrace":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/livenessfusiontrace","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LivenessFusionTrace","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Public per-frame fusion trace for debug UI \/ CSV capture."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Mirrors the inputs that drove "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"evaluateFusedTrust"},{"type":"text","text":" plus the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hysteresis state, so a host can reconstruct exactly why the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" differs from the raw fused decision."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LivenessFusionTrace"}],"title":"LivenessFusionTrace","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFusionTrace","type":"topic"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/VerificationOutcome/similarity":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/VerificationOutcome\/similarity","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The best comparison score seen in the window; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when no face"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was acquired or no reference is enrolled."}],"role":"symbol","title":"similarity","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"similarity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Float","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/verificationoutcome\/similarity","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/InconclusiveReason":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/inconclusivereason","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InconclusiveReason","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why a liveness check could not reach a live-or-spoof verdict — for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example still initialising or insufficient depth data this frame."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InconclusiveReason","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"InconclusiveReason","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InconclusiveReason","type":"topic"},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/yeofacelivenessdetectorresult","abstract":[{"text":"The outcome of a TrueDepth liveness check: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".live"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".spoof"},{"text":" (with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/SpoofReason","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" explaining the depth-geometry failure), or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".inconclusive"},{"text":" (with an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/InconclusiveReason","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"title":"YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"YEOFaceLivenessDetectorResult","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.yeomessaging.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceEvaluationResult/livenessWarmingUp":{"url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/faceevaluationresult\/livenesswarmingup","title":"livenessWarmingUp","abstract":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" while no decided liveness verdict stands for the face: a face is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in view with no verdict yet, or the CNN is collecting the evidence for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one (its verdict rule’s evidence window has started filling and is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"yet full, or the first inference into an empty window is running)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" once a verdict stands, while the CNN is off, with no face in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view and nothing collecting, and on a frame the framing gate refused."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"livenessWarmingUp","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","p